WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.439 --> 00:00:02.733
- He's a Brazilian mixed martial artist,

00:00:02.733 --> 00:00:05.437
and former UFC Middleweight Champion.

00:00:05.437 --> 00:00:08.944
He holds the longest title-defense
streak in UFC history,

00:00:08.944 --> 00:00:10.963
with 16 consecutive wins,

00:00:10.963 --> 00:00:12.999
and 10 title defenses.

00:00:12.999 --> 00:00:15.763
UFC President Dana White and other experts

00:00:15.763 --> 00:00:18.600
have called him the greatest
mixed martial artist

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:19.561
of all time.

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:22.005
He's Anderson Silva,
and here are his top-10

00:00:22.005 --> 00:00:23.505
rules for success.

00:00:26.494 --> 00:00:28.864
- I love my sport.

00:00:28.864 --> 00:00:31.114
I love my job, and

00:00:31.992 --> 00:00:35.431
I strive my focus, all the time,

00:00:35.431 --> 00:00:38.848
in my life, for training, because

00:00:40.315 --> 00:00:43.232
fight is my life.

00:00:45.601 --> 00:00:47.202
Sometimes, everything's changed,

00:00:47.202 --> 00:00:50.520
because you have the good

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:52.674
working, bad working,

00:00:52.674 --> 00:00:55.655
and good experience, bad experience,

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:57.930
but I love my job.

00:00:57.930 --> 00:00:59.969
And I talk to my family,

00:00:59.969 --> 00:01:02.311
and I say I go back to fight,

00:01:02.311 --> 00:01:05.318
because this is me.

00:01:05.318 --> 00:01:09.013
("Born to be Wild" by Steppenwolf)

00:01:09.013 --> 00:01:11.113
- [Commentator] Silva looking
to overwhelm Marquardt

00:01:11.113 --> 00:01:13.194
