00:01:13.194 --> 00:01:15.296
Oh, caught him with a big shot.

00:01:15.296 --> 00:01:17.664
- That might be it.
- Marquardt is in trouble.

00:01:17.664 --> 00:01:20.087
- It is all over!
- Wow!

00:01:20.087 --> 00:01:22.537
- [Commentator] Anderson Silva remains

00:01:22.537 --> 00:01:24.506
the Middleweight Champion.

00:01:24.506 --> 00:01:28.423
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:31.497 --> 00:01:33.053
